{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prehistoric Fury</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roar, breathe fire, shoot firebolts, dodge and roll mid-air, launch special attacks, and make use of loadouts of suit your playstyle. Become dragons with your friends and see who is the best at fiery attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/186051fe92fbaf47adb142c3a5ab7ba3.poster.avif?t=1763738259\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/186051fe92fbaf47adb142c3a5ab7ba3.webm?t=1763738259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/186051fe92fbaf47adb142c3a5ab7ba3.mp4?t=1763738259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom Games, Offline vs Bots, &amp; LAN Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the way you want, set your own rules, with or without internet. Offline play earns you the same rewards as multiplayer. Perfect for LAN parties and cafes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/35334b82a6b3bd5caf53d9d869ed49df.poster.avif?t=1763738259\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/35334b82a6b3bd5caf53d9d869ed49df.webm?t=1763738259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/35334b82a6b3bd5caf53d9d869ed49df.mp4?t=1763738259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Dragon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive character &amp; profile customization to express your dragon personality to your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/e99c7af7c3752a439351e51f3675df5f.poster.avif?t=1763738259\" width=434 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/e99c7af7c3752a439351e51f3675df5f.webm?t=1763738259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/e99c7af7c3752a439351e51f3675df5f.mp4?t=1763738259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fierce Competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See where you stack up in the global and regional leaderboard, push yourself to improve and climb the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/7d5934b3b461e6e5364a5a969697b098.poster.avif?t=1763738259\" width=434 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/7d5934b3b461e6e5364a5a969697b098.webm?t=1763738259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/814330/extras/7d5934b3b461e6e5364a5a969697b098.mp4?t=1763738259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One-Time Purchase, Yours to Unlock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions, no online-only content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Mouse &amp; keyboard input is highly\u00a0recommended.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This production does not use any AI-generated assets or code.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/814330?t=17637